  "title": "Warm Peppery Vietnamese Chicken Noodles",
  "description": "A peppery and tender Vietnamese dish featuring farfalle noodles, cooked to perfection in a clay pot, low in carbs and big on flavor",
  "cuisine": "Vietnamese",
